        "title": "Nobiletin induces apoptosis and potentiates the effects of the anticancer drug 5-fluorouracil in p53-mutated SNU-16 human gastric cancer cells.",
        "authorString": "Moon JY, Cho M, Ahn KS, Cho SK.",
